30Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4962300","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1847286114035433","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"announcement","title":"What's coming in the released Potion-making?","summary":"Hi, alchemists!Many of you have already brewed a few potions (and stolen a few) in the demo, so you know the core of the game. Now we'd like to show you what's coming on top of it in the full release on November 10: more maps, more ways to play, and a little bit of style for your alchemist.All six mapsThe demo gives you a taste of the game, and the full version opens up all six locations. Each one changes how you plan your route across the Travel Board, so a strategy that works on one map may fa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:26:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035433","verified_at":"2026-10-23T12:05:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1846651706691595","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"announcement","title":"We're Part of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello, alchemists!Steam Next Fest is here, and Potion-making: Path of the Alchemist is part of it!From October 19–26, Steam is celebrating upcoming games, and we're excited to join the festival with our demo.If you haven't tried Potion-making yet, now's the perfect time. Brew potions, combine recipes, cast spells, and race your opponents to three Places of Power. Play solo against AI or invite your friends for some online alchemical chaos.Our demo is free to play on Steam, so jump in and give it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:08:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1846651706680241","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"announcement","title":"From Tabletop to Digital: How We Brought Potion-making to PC","summary":"Hello, alchemists!Did you know that Potion-making: Path of the Alchemist started as a tabletop game more than 20 years ago? Today, we'd like to tell you a little about its history, how we brought it to PC, and what makes the digital version special.A little history of Potion-makingThe story began in 2005, when game designer Sergey Machin created Potion-Making: Practice, a card game about combining magical ingredients to brew potions, elixirs, and other alchemical creations.The game became a tabl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:19:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680241","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1846018067933270","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"update","title":"Tournament update: new date coming soon","summary":"Hi everyone!We’re moving our first tournament for the digital version of Potion-making: Path of the Alchemist to a different date. We need a bit more time to get everything ready and run the tournament the way it deserves.What about registration?If you’ve already filled out the form, you’re still on the list, and there’s no need to register again. We’ll announce the new date later, and if it doesn’t work for you, just let us know in the comments under our next post about the tournament. We’ll pa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T13:13:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1845383656378048","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"announcement","title":"The Multiplayer Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"More than a year ago, development began with a half-joking question: “What if we brought the original Potion-making tabletop game to PC?” What followed were countless prototypes, playtests, sleepless nights, and a whole lot of hard work...Today, we're finally ready to share the result with you. For the first time, you can play Potion-making: Path of the Alchemist online! Invite your friends or join a match with other players, and brew potions together!What’s in the demo:A tutorial mission to hel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T15:29:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1844751498231834","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"announcement","title":"Calling All Alchemists: Join Our First Tournament!","summary":"Hello alchemists!We are getting ready to release the full version of Alchemy: The Alchemist's Path — and to celebrate, we're inviting you to take part in the very first tournament for the digital version of the game!The tournament is open to 16 participants, selected on a first-come, first-served basis for those who fill out the registration form first. Didn’t make it this time? No worries! We’ll keep all submitted forms and take them into account when organizing future tournaments.📅 When: Octob","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T15:35:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231834","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1841579228678154","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Build Update - Reworked Tutorial, Sounds and Camera!","summary":"Hello from the Oduvan Games team! We’ve prepared a major update and are excited to share it with you.We’ve focused on making your first steps into the game smoother, clearer, and more enjoyable. All of these changes are already available in the new build. So let’s take a closer look!What’s changed?Completely revamped tutorialThe tutorial is now a separate mission that takes you from the beginning of a match all the way to your first Place of Power. Along the way, you’ll learn all the core mechan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T12:15:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3710120-1835871199312779","game_id":"steam-3710120","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed playtest coming soon!","summary":"Greetings from the Oduvan Games team! In 2026, Potion-Making: Path of the Alchemist will bring the beloved board game Potion-Making to digital platforms. Sign-ups for the closed playtest will open on June 23th.Potion-Making is a card game where players collect magical ingredients and transform simple starter potions into increasingly powerful creations. The original board game has become a true classic, with more than 300,000 boxes sold over the past two decades. The digital adaptation expands t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T11:59:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199312779","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3710120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:49Z","status":"ok","all_source